312
00:15:42,656 --> 00:15:43,716
Böyle bir ortamda.

313
00:15:43,716 --> 00:15:46,616
Fransız devriminin vatanseverlik,

314
00:15:46,836 --> 00:15:47,796
eşitlik, özgürlük,

315
00:15:48,436 --> 00:15:50,036
